	<key>readme</key>
	<string># PiHop

Hop into pi / Claude Code agent sessions grouped by project.

## Usage
- `agent` — project list (auto-discovered from ~/.pi/agent/sessions and ~/.claude)
- ⏎ on a project — its sessions
- ⏎ on a session — resume it in the terminal · ⌘↵ on "Start new session" — pick the agent
- ← Back items return to the previous list

## Configuration (workflow variables / Configuration)
- `DEFAULT_AGENT` — agent used by Enter on "Start new session" (pi | claude)
- `AGENT_TERMINAL` — iTerm / Terminal / kitty / template with {file}

Requires Alfred 5+.</string>
